  "bio": "Adrien Tender is a traditional style tattoo artist based in Calgary, Canada. A professional in the field since 2015, he impressively masters the subtleties of the old school aesthetic, flawlessly translating them into an indelible body art form. Contact him through his email, adrien.tender@gmail.com, to experience his exemplary artistic craftsmanship.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Calgary, Alberta, Canada\n\nArtistic Tattooing Since 2015\nColmar, FR\nIf you would like to get tattooed, please email me at adrien.tender@gmail.com",
